00:13:10,588 --> 00:13:16,588
Masked and Anonymous is a drama, music film directed by Larry Charles.

3
00:19:45,882 --> 00:19:51,882
A nation wracked with civil war and social unrest anticipates a giant charity concert, organized by
deceptive promoter Uncle Sweetheart, who plans on raking in huge sums for himself from the event.

4
00:26:21,176 --> 00:26:27,176
Headlining is legendary musician Jack Fate, whose prison
time is cut short with Sweetheart's help.

5
00:32:56,470 --> 00:33:02,470
Meanwhile, journalist Tom Friend investigates the corrupt concert
and sets out to unmask the truth to the public.

6
